Do not delete: this patch starts from patches/sqlite/0001-row-counts-plain.patch in
Cloudflare's workerd (https://github.com/cloudflare/workerd), Apache License 2.0,
with its comments and its shell hunk removed and its other hunks applied to the
SQLite amalgamation.
workerd took the row-counting code from libSQL (https://github.com/tursodatabase/libsql),
Copyright 2022 the libSQL authors, MIT licence. NOTICE at the repository root
contains the licence text.
Sirannon changed the patch: both counters hold 64 bits, sirannon_stmt_status64
reads them in place of sqlite3_stmt_status, and neither counter includes the work
of a trigger whose name begins with _sirannon_trg_ or the sqlite_sequence
bookkeeping for a table whose name begins with _sirannon_.

